From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: kennytech73 <contact@bookworm-mon0.org>
Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 18:00:00 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] drm/cix: dptx: full reset before link up while audio runs

HDMI audio on Orange Pi 6 Plus goes silent after a screen wake (DPMS
off/on) when the audio stream stays open: the link comes back with the
I2S stream already running, SEC0_AUDIO_FIFO_READY stays at 0 and only a
reboot brings audio back. Re-plugging the cable, toggling AUDIO_ENABLE
or rebinding the sound card and I2S do not help. The full controller
reset done at boot (reset_dp_and_reinit) is skipped on these wakes,
because core_off clears DP_STATE_INIT_TRAIN.

In trilin_dp_prepare(), do the full reset before link up when audio is
running. Tested on 3 short wakes and 2 wakes after 15 minutes, each with
the sink bouncing HPD a few seconds later: FIFO_READY back to 1 and
audio restored every time. Can be turned off with
trilin_dpsub.audio_reset=0 (writable at runtime).

Signed-off-by: kennytech73 <contact@bookworm-mon0.org>
---
--- a/drivers/gpu/drm/cix/dptx/trilin_dptx.c
+++ b/drivers/gpu/drm/cix/dptx/trilin_dptx.c
@@ -74,6 +74,17 @@ static uint trilin_dp_power_on_delay_ms = DEFUALT_DP_POWER_ON_DELAY_MS;
 module_param_named(power_on_delay_ms, trilin_dp_power_on_delay_ms, uint, 0444);
 MODULE_PARM_DESC(power_on_delay_ms, "DP power on delay in msec (default: 4)");
 
+/*
+ * When the link is brought back up while an audio stream is running
+ * (screen wake after DPMS off, HPD bounce of the sink), the audio FIFO
+ * of the controller does not resync with the I2S stream and audio stays
+ * silent until reboot (SEC0_AUDIO_FIFO_READY stuck at 0). A full
+ * controller reset before link up, as done at boot, makes it resync.
+ */
+static bool trilin_dp_audio_reset = true;
+module_param_named(audio_reset, trilin_dp_audio_reset, bool, 0644);
+MODULE_PARM_DESC(audio_reset, "Full DP reset before link up while audio is running (default: on)");
+
 //Define
 #define MAX_MST_SLOTS 64
 #define MISC0_USE_SYNC_CLOCK 0
@@ -3052,6 +3063,10 @@ int trilin_dp_prepare(struct trilin_dp *dp)
 	} else if (dp->state & DP_STATE_INIT_TRAIN){
 		reset_dp_and_reinit(dp);
 		usleep_range(100, 200);
+	} else if (trilin_dp_audio_reset && dp->dp_audio.running) {
+		DP_INFO("audio running: full DP reset before link up\n");
+		reset_dp_and_reinit(dp);
+		usleep_range(100, 200);
 	}
 
 	if (!trilin_dp_is_ready(dp)) {
